capability logs/record  a line of `log` as OTLP's log record, with its span's trace and id
  heroes  tracing.log_record, tracing.LogRecord
  go      log.Record, Record.SetBody, SetTimestamp, SetObservedTimestamp, SetSeverity, SetSeverityText, AddAttributes, Body, Timestamp, ObservedTimestamp, Severity, SeverityText, WalkAttributes, AttributesLen, Clone, EventName, SetEventName, Err, SetErr, log.Severity, sdk/log.Record, Record.SetTraceID, SetSpanID, SetTraceFlags, TraceID, SpanID, TraceFlags, Resource, InstrumentationScope, DroppedAttributes, SetAttributes
