dropped  each SDK's plumbing: no-op implementations, embedded interfaces, error handlers and the getters of option structs
  go      trace.Span's embedded interfaces, TracerProvider.Tracer of the no-op, otel.ErrorHandler, ErrorHandlerFunc, GetErrorHandler, SetErrorHandler, Handle, SetLogger, Version, every *Config's getters (Attributes, Timestamp, StackTrace, SpanKind, Links, NewRoot, InstrumentationVersion, InstrumentationAttributes, SchemaURL), sdk/trace.ReadOnlySpan's methods
